OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 7 DEC
OL,4,G1700FThe Early Music Show
OL,5,     GHannah French explores the life
OL,6,     Gand music of the 18th Century
OL,7,     GCuban composer Esteban Salas y
OL,8,     GCastro, who is particularly
OL,9,     Gassociated with music for the
OL,10,     Gfestive season.
OL,11,G1800FWords and Music
OL,12,     GFrom the balls at Meryton and
OL,13,     GNetherfield in Pride and
OL,14,     GPrejudice to the gift of a piano
OL,15,     Gin Emma, music features strongly
OL,16,     Gin the novels of Jane Austen, who
OL,17,     Gwas born 250 years ago.
