OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 7 DEC
OL,4,G1915FBetween the Ears: A Hymn to Water
OL,5,     GThe River Eden has flowed through
OL,6,     Gthe life of poet Jacob Polley,
OL,7,     Gshaping this thoughtful
OL,8,     Gcontemplation of water. Vocals:
OL,9,     GKathryn Williams. Music and
OL,10,     Gsound: Strijbos & Van Rijswijk.
OL,11,G1945FSunday Feature: New Generation
OL,12,     FThinkers shorts
OL,13,     GNew Generation Thinker Rebecca
OL,14,     GWoods looks at how cassette tapes
OL,15,     Gprovided continuity and sometimes
OL,16,     Gled to conflict between diaspora
OL,17,     Gcommunities from Asia and Africa.
OL,18,G2000FDebussy: Pelleas and Melisande
OL,19,     GA chance to hear more of
OL,20,     Gyesterday's Building a Library
OL,21,     Grecommendation, as well as other
OL,22,     Gnew releases from the week.
