OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 7 DEC
OL,4,G2100F20th Century Radicals
OL,5,     GKate Molleson and Gillian Moore
OL,6,     Gshine new light on the 'modern'
OL,7,     Gmusic of the 20th century. This
OL,8,     Gweek, Gillian explores the world
OL,9,     Gof spectralism and the music of
OL,10,     GTristan Murail.
OL,11,G2200FCompline
OL,12,     GA reflective service of night
OL,13,     Gprayer from the Chapel of Keble
OL,14,     GCollege, Oxford. With music by
OL,15,     GSally Beamish, Richard Pantcheff
OL,16,     Gand Cecilia McDowall.
OL,17,G2230FNight Tracks
OL,18,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,19,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,20,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,21,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,22,     Geverything in between.
